{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of space, enemy forces are swarming toward your base.<br>As commander, you must build and upgrade defensive installations within limited space and resources to withstand wave after wave of attackers. A dynamic tower-defense experience: enemies won't charge blindly \u2014 they detect, warn, and try to bypass your defenses, forcing you to constantly adapt your deployments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied towers: towers with different functions can be combined freely to craft the strategy best suited to repel the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic map design: each map features unique routes and nodes, and your choices directly affect the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating challenge: as waves progress, enemies grow stronger and smarter \u2014 you must upgrade your technology to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense space atmosphere: with sci-fi visuals and immersive audio, the combat experience is intense and gripping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, placing a single tower won't guarantee victory \u2014 you must think globally and respond flexibly. Only the wisest commanders will hold the last line of defense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975220?t=1761357672","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975220/81ac502da5ad0cfe63811d6e604e6b0ae3402528/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761357672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975220/f082ed4fd576b54649cbaf5efeb2dd8cc0705782/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761357672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975220/f082ed4fd576b54649cbaf5efeb2dd8cc0705782/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761357672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of space, enemy forces are swarming toward your base.<br>As commander, you must build and upgrade defensive installations within limited space and resources to withstand wave after wave of attackers. A dynamic tower-defense experience: enemies won't charge blindly \u2014 they detect, warn, and try to bypass your defenses, forcing you to constantly adapt your deployments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied towers: towers with different functions can be combined freely to craft the strategy best suited to repel the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic map design: each map features unique routes and nodes, and your choices directly affect the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating challenge: as waves progress, enemies grow stronger and smarter \u2014 you must upgrade your technology to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense space atmosphere: with sci-fi visuals and immersive audio, the combat experience is intense and gripping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, placing a single tower won't guarantee victory \u2014 you must think globally and respond flexibly. Only the wisest commanders will hold the last line of defense.</p>","developers":["KKDM"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975220/cb424b2a69238d2639e573ffcbee2457e6e6f7e5/header.jpg?t=1761357672","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3975220/1806946062/2b03a37ef7f2ac3563fb9de756135b6afe12c